OL,3,ASyria says Israeli strike near Damascus
OL,4,Aviolation of international law
OL,5,
OL,6,FSyria has condemned an Israeli attack
OL,7,Fon the village of Beit Jinn, southwest
OL,8,Fof the country's capital Damascus,
OL,9,Fwhich officials said hit a civilian
OL,10,Fvehicle and left several people
OL,11,Finjured.
OL,13,FThe attack was the second known Israeli
OL,14,Fstrike on Syria in the past week, with
OL,15,FSyria branding it a "violation" of its
OL,16,Fsovereignty and international law.
OL,18,FIn a post on X, the Israeli military
OL,19,Fsaid it had targeted a "terrorist" in
OL,20,Fthe "final stages" of preparing attacks
OL,21,Fwhich posed an immediate threat to
OL,22,Fsoldiers.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
