OL,3,ASyria says Israeli strike near Damascus
OL,4,Aviolation of international law
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest incident comes days after
OL,7,Freports emerged Israel had struck a
OL,8,Fmilitary airbase close to the Turkish
OL,9,Fborder, which Syria said threatened to
OL,10,Fescalate tensions in the region.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
